{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>A Simple Job</strong> \u2013 A game that slowly drives you insane... for free! \ud83c\udf00</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new dream job! Your task? Super simple:<br><strong>Just don\u2019t press the red button.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy, right? \ud83d\ude07 Well... it <i>would be</i> if it weren\u2019t for that <strong>annoying voice</strong> constantly yapping in your ear.<br>Imagine Clippy from the 2000s had too much coffee, a podcast mic, and zero chill. \ud83c\udfa4\ud83d\ude35</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many ridiculous ways this \u201csimple\u201d game can end \u2014 there are more endings than you\u2019ll have reasons to <i>distrust that button.</i> \ud83d\udca3</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 One (suspiciously good-looking) red button that can ruin everything<br>\ud83e\udde0 Multiple endings, ranging from \u201cmeh\u201d to \u201cWHAT JUST HAPPENED?!\u201d<br>\ud83e\udd47 A small but <i>mighty</i> list of achievements \u2014 <strong>more coming if people like it!</strong><br>\ud83d\ude35 A narrator voice you\u2019ll regret meeting (and it regrets you too)<br>\ud83d\udcb8 100% free (because even we know this got out of hand)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So... do you accept the job?<br>\ud83d\udd15 Don\u2019t press the button.<br>\ud83d\udd14 Or... maybe do? \ud83d\udc40<br>(And if you like it, we\u2019ll make it even worse. Promise.) \ud83d\ude08</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You couldn't resist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/5cfdd6089ca0ae05db2aa48921f2d6ca7bb36590.jpg"},{"name":"What no, don't do that!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/9ecb4f5ccf2211dc0d01d5da131c4239f13e9652.jpg"},{"name":"Be Patient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/98a24982fad88face36c6651e4682bb7606ca975.jpg"},{"name":"Quit the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/895e928a9a1a67249f87bbc78362152dd0e941d6.jpg"},{"name":"Rocket man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/68bd420821aaafa0fbc20554178485eeb723448c.jpg"},{"name":"You had negative points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/ab0836af9d94e01e3c263fa6c99da30b2d1b8cfd.jpg"},{"name":"At least 18 points - congrats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/ab0836af9d94e01e3c263fa6c99da30b2d1b8cfd.jpg"},{"name":"Have a sip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/d0321fe927db9591c2ae3f16189f30d7a00a50bf.jpg"},{"name":"Sleep on the Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/f8a1e00b28ac3221d10cb7f49728473281778a05.jpg"},{"name":"Not the brightest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734980/5a06e06389dfd46351f32dd3dd852679d012da45.jpg"}],"total":53},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734980?t=1769771673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734980?t=1769771673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734980/e036b33c55672415aee7df0008bf5a0fff6e9c09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769771673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734980/e036b33c55672415aee7df0008bf5a0fff6e9c09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769771673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>A Simple Job</strong> \u2013 A game that slowly drives you insane... for free! \ud83c\udf00</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new dream job! Your task? Super simple:<br><strong>Just don\u2019t press the red button.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy, right? \ud83d\ude07 Well... it <i>would be</i> if it weren\u2019t for that <strong>annoying voice</strong> constantly yapping in your ear.<br>Imagine Clippy from the 2000s had too much coffee, a podcast mic, and zero chill. \ud83c\udfa4\ud83d\ude35</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many ridiculous ways this \u201csimple\u201d game can end \u2014 there are more endings than you\u2019ll have reasons to <i>distrust that button.</i> \ud83d\udca3</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 One (suspiciously good-looking) red button that can ruin everything<br>\ud83e\udde0 Multiple endings, ranging from \u201cmeh\u201d to \u201cWHAT JUST HAPPENED?!\u201d<br>\ud83e\udd47 A small but <i>mighty</i> list of achievements \u2014 <strong>more coming if people like it!</strong><br>\ud83d\ude35 A narrator voice you\u2019ll regret meeting (and it regrets you too)<br>\ud83d\udcb8 100% free (because even we know this got out of hand)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So... do you accept the job?<br>\ud83d\udd15 Don\u2019t press the button.<br>\ud83d\udd14 Or... maybe do? \ud83d\udc40<br>(And if you like it, we\u2019ll make it even worse. Promise.) \ud83d\ude08</p>","developers":["Saturn91","DreamStudios"],"dlc":[3829860],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734980/f229a975d433357df1b194a1e4076872b6b44b3e/header.jpg?t=1769771673","is_free":true,"linux_re